        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "In twenty fifteen, Pizza Hut sold 16.9% of America's pizza.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.45,
        "window": 4.1,
        "fill": 0.841
      },
      {
        "scene": "swap",
        "text": "Domino's sold less. Ten years later, the two have traded places, and it isn't close. So how did the leader lose?",
        "start": 4.4,
        "seconds": 5.18,
        "window": 5.83,
        "fill": 0.889
      },
      {
        "scene": "roofs",
        "text": "Pizza Hut built its name on red-roof restaurants, where families sat down to eat.",
        "start": 10.23,
